SIMPLE  =                    T / conforms to FITS standard                      BITPIX  =                    8 / array data type                                NAXIS   =                    0 / number of array dimensions                     EXTEND  =                    T                                                  END                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                             XTENSION= 'BINTABLE'           / binary table extension                         BITPIX  =                    8 / array data type                                NAXIS   =                    2 / number of array dimensions                     NAXIS1  =                   32 / width of table in bytes                        NAXIS2  =                    8 / number of rows in table                        PCOUNT  =                  971 / number of group parameters                     GCOUNT  =                    1 / number of groups                               TFIELDS =                    4 / number of fields in each row                   ZIMAGE  =                    T / extension contains compressed image            ZTENSION= 'IMAGE   '           / Image extension                                ZBITPIX =                  -64 / array data type                                ZNAXIS  =                    2 / number of array dimensions                     ZNAXIS1 =                   32                                                  ZNAXIS2 =                   32                                                  